  "raw_text": "PLAN \"12-Week General Fitness Program for 58-year-old male post-MI (moderate-intensity, HR cap 115 bpm)\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary strength:\n    name \"Improve general fitness and functional capacity within moderate-intensity, HR-controlled limits\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Phase 1\" (4 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Intro to resistance and conditioning\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          chest_press 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          seated_row 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          overhead_press 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          hip_thrust 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          goblet_squat 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 60 seconds\n          lat_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 2:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Progression and stability\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          incline_press 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          cable_row 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          dumbbell_shoulder_press 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          hip_thrust 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          goblet_squat 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 60 seconds\n          calf_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 3:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Technique and light load\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 2x10..15 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x10..15 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          bench_press 2x10..15 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          seated_row 2x10..15 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          overhead_press 2x10..15 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x10..15 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          glute_bridge 2x10..15 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          split_squat 2x10..15 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 60 seconds\n          back_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 4:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Recovery and scope check\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          incline_press 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          cable_row 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          goblet_squat 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 60 seconds\n          hamstring_stretch 60 seconds\n\n  PHASE \"Phase 2\" (4 weeks):\n    WEEK 5:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Progressive loading with cadence control\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 6 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          cable_row 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_shoulder_press 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          hip_thrust 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          goblet_squat 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 60 seconds\n          hip_flexor_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 6:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Technique and endurance\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 6 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          bench_press 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          seated_row 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          overhead_press 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          hip_thrust 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          split_squat 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 60 seconds\n          calf_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 7:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Balance and mobility focus\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 6 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          cable_row 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_shoulder_press 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          glute_bridge 3x12..20 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          back_stretch 60 seconds\n          figure_four_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 8:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Assess and adjust\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 6 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          bench_press 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          seated_row 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          overhead_press 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          hip_thrust 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          goblet_squat 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 60 seconds\n          hip_stretch 60 seconds\n\n  PHASE \"Phase 3\" (4 weeks):\n    WEEK 9:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Strength progression with control\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 6 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 3x6..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 3x6..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 3x6..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          cable_row 3x6..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_shoulder_press 3x6..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x6..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          hip_thrust 3x6..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          goblet_squat 3x6..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 10:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Endurance and stability\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 6 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          bench_press 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          seated_row 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          overhead_press 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          hip_thrust 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          split_squat 3x10..15 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 60 seconds\n          hip_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 11:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Heart-rate aware deload\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 6 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          incline_press 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          cable_row 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n          goblet_squat 2x8..12 rpe 4 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          back_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 12:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Program consolidation and testing\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 6 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_extension 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          bench_press 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          seated_row 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          overhead_press 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          hip_thrust 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n          goblet_squat 3x8..12 rpe 5 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 60 seconds\n          hip_stretch 60 seconds\n\nEND",
